[21.730277, "o", "The theorem states that addition is commutative for natural numbers (forall n m : nat, n + m = m + n).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> The proof attempt uses induction but is missing some crucial steps.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[21.730341, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> Your task is to:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[21.730436, "o", "1. Analyze the incomplete proof in plus_comm.v\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[21.730517, "o", "2. Add the missing steps to complete the proof\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> 3. Compile the completed proof using coqc\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
